type: software
title: "Trainable Superpixel Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Trainable Superpixel Segmentation (TSS) is an ImageJ 1.x / Fiji plugin for interactively segmenting images by annotating superpixels, training a classifier, and applying it to the image.
